# AVD-AWS-0107: Security group ingress allows traffic from 0.0.0.0/0
# Intentional — lab/demo cluster needs public access on 22, 6443, 30080, 30443
AVD-AWS-0107

# AVD-AWS-0104: Security group egress allows traffic to 0.0.0.0/0
# Default allow-all egress required for EC2 to pull packages and container images
AVD-AWS-0104

# KSV014: readOnlyRootFilesystem = false
# App requires write access to /tmp for temporary files
KSV014

# KSV020: runAsUser < 10000
# Using UID 1000 — standard non-root user, acceptable for lab/demo
KSV020
